00:26:06.470 --> 00:26:07.820
No. Good luck.

00:26:08.040 --> 00:26:09.080
It's all set this time.

00:26:14.630 --> 00:26:16.970
All set every Tuesday for 12 years.

00:26:19.920 --> 00:26:22.560
12 years from now, it'll still be next Tuesday.

00:26:24.520 --> 00:26:27.480
Look, Gallagher, I know this drum's full of crackpots.

00:26:28.340 --> 00:26:29.980
One con's gonna buy his way out, another...

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:33.220
the governor's cousin. A third guy's even going to float out in a homemade balloon.

00:26:33.750 --> 00:26:35.170
But I'm not buying any pipe dreams.

00:26:35.370 --> 00:26:41.000
It can be done. It can be done before. It'll be done again.

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:44.600
It can be done here by us, by you and me.

00:26:45.520 --> 00:26:47.720
Collins, if I ever put in with anybody, it'll be with you.

00:26:50.890 --> 00:26:51.950
There's no need for that now.

00:26:53.290 --> 00:26:54.410
You, I can tell why.

00:26:56.620 --> 00:26:59.960
Promise me my parole very soon.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:09.800
now i'll be walking out of here tuesday could be next how long can we go

00:27:31.660 --> 00:27:34.060
White tie and tails for the movie tonight.

00:27:34.380 --> 00:27:37.120
The boy gets the girl and that's all right.

00:27:38.320 --> 00:27:38.940
It is, too.

00:27:42.630 --> 00:27:43.110
Checkmate.

00:27:45.240 --> 00:27:46.060
Be again, soldier?

00:27:46.510 --> 00:27:48.990
Yeah, chess, dominoes, whatever we play.

00:27:49.560 --> 00:27:50.560
Don't you ever lose?

00:27:50.720 --> 00:27:51.760
Very seldom, friend.

00:27:52.290 --> 00:27:54.850
I was born with what you might call the golden tut.

00:27:55.800 --> 00:27:57.360
I almost win the golden gloves once.

00:27:58.140 --> 00:27:59.980
They give me a watch and a robe with my name.

00:28:03.300 --> 00:28:05.460
I'll be in the infirmary. I gotta see a guy.

00:28:05.640 --> 00:28:06.240
Still figuring?

00:28:07.290 --> 00:28:09.580
Still. Save me a seat at the movie.

00:28:10.590 --> 00:28:11.190
Take it easy, lady.

00:28:18.140 --> 00:28:20.120
What goes between you guys and this thing?

00:28:20.450 --> 00:28:22.670
Watch your language, my own romantic friend.

00:28:23.110 --> 00:28:24.290
You're speaking of a lady.

00:28:24.550 --> 00:28:26.590
It's enough to give somebody to creeps.

00:28:26.920 --> 00:28:28.660
You fellas smiling at a picture,

00:28:29.040 --> 00:28:29.980
throwing kisses at...

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:37.230
You might think she was real she is after a while you'll get to know it too true to me

00:28:37.230 --> 00:28:45.540
She looks exactly like like my wife so ordinary pinup girl to each one of us

00:28:45.540 --> 00:28:49.500
She's somebody special you mean if I keep looking at her long enough like you fellas

00:28:49.500 --> 00:28:59.870
She'll begin to remind me of Henrietta right Henrietta's a blonde. She don't look nothing

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:06.960
like her she doesn't have to our calendar girl is just an inspiration brother coy she starts you

00:29:06.960 --> 00:29:12.420
thinking about the one you really want to see for example the last couple of days now she's had me

00:29:12.420 --> 00:29:20.720
thinking about flossy i never told you gentlemen about flossy did i to me she's all the women i

00:29:20.720 --> 00:29:29.980
ever knew phew i hope i haven't met yet i ran into flossy one night in eddie's place in my

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:34.990
I had just sold a trusting gentleman a few shares in a radium mine,

00:29:35.180 --> 00:29:36.900
but I was trying to parlay my luck.

00:29:37.100 --> 00:29:42.040
I had only met Flossie that afternoon, but we were already very good friends.

00:29:42.530 --> 00:29:44.570
The dice were hot and she kept them that way.

00:29:45.050 --> 00:29:46.470
I was heading for a fortune.

00:29:47.390 --> 00:29:50.210
Suddenly, just when everything was sunshine and roses,

00:29:50.610 --> 00:29:52.490
I heard the old familiar noises.

00:29:53.260 --> 00:29:55.660
Beavered to the police to break up a wonderful evening.

00:29:56.250 --> 00:29:58.770
It looked as though everybody was caught with their chips down.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:03.120
The raid didn't worry me, but the gun I was carrying was a problem.

00:30:03.830 --> 00:30:06.330
So Flossie had me slip the gun into her purse.

00:30:06.770 --> 00:30:09.940
She was not only beautiful, she knew the score as well.

00:30:10.760 --> 00:30:13.820
Furthermore, she knew precisely how to guide me through a back exit.

00:30:14.200 --> 00:30:15.860
Obviously, the girl was no tourist.

00:30:16.180 --> 00:30:18.900
My car was waiting there just as pretty as you please.

00:30:19.610 --> 00:30:23.010
And with my money and my gun still safe, off we drove.

00:30:24.080 --> 00:30:28.760
Driving along with such a dream doll beside me, I figured myself a pretty lucky guy.

00:30:29.280 --> 00:30:29.980
Flossie had...

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.500
Looks, brains, and all the accessories.

00:30:33.350 --> 00:30:35.330
She was better than a deck with six aces.

00:30:35.840 --> 00:30:39.480
But I regret to report that she also knew how to handle a gun.

00:30:40.690 --> 00:30:41.310
My gun!

00:30:42.310 --> 00:30:44.710
Before, I had only suspected that she was talented.

00:30:45.200 --> 00:30:46.400
Now I was positive.

00:30:47.890 --> 00:30:52.070
I didn't do much talking because for once in my life, I couldn't find the right words.

00:30:52.810 --> 00:30:56.230
She wanted all the money I'd won, and I never refuse a lady.

00:30:56.990 --> 00:30:58.370
Especially when she's armed.

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:04.320
Unfortunately, I stepped out of the automobile without any arguments whatsoever.

00:31:05.560 --> 00:31:12.250
And that gentleman was the last I ever saw of my car, my cash, or my Flossie.

00:31:13.700 --> 00:31:16.060
I wonder who Flossie's fleecing now.

00:31:23.230 --> 00:31:27.490
I don't get it. Why would a guy want to hang on to a memory like that?

00:31:28.140 --> 00:31:29.980
Who knows? I guess...

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:36.660
when you're on the inside even the phony things on the outside seem wonderful just so they happened

00:31:36.660 --> 00:31:54.710
on the outside all right go ahead joe how's the boy johnny

00:32:17.880 --> 00:32:18.460
me, Colin.

