If they don't get jammed under the brooder and smother or drown in the drinking fountain or get coccidiosis or peck each other to death, we may be in the chicken business yet.

00:34:09.820 --> 00:34:15.340
After you've fed and watered them every three hours, what you have to do until they can take care of themselves, you won't feel so sentimental.

00:34:17.770 --> 00:34:18.070
Stop.

00:34:18.880 --> 00:34:19.660
Dating the cell.

00:34:20.420 --> 00:34:21.640
Another letter to his way.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:18.730
I'll give you in a minute.

00:35:18.910 --> 00:35:19.670
Oh, take your time.

00:35:21.140 --> 00:35:21.540
Anything new?

00:35:22.620 --> 00:35:23.220
Around here?

00:35:26.450 --> 00:35:28.330
Went into Harry Thomas and his wife today.

00:35:29.110 --> 00:35:29.970
Thought it'd be a good idea to get...

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:31.260
Maybe sometime soon.

00:35:34.140 --> 00:35:35.680
You mean we might be going out for a change?

00:35:42.540 --> 00:35:43.100
Make a wish.

00:35:44.660 --> 00:35:45.660
