00:35:58.050 --> 00:35:58.860
Here, put it on.

00:36:01.790 --> 00:36:06.070
Beautiful. Most beautiful thing in the whole world.

00:36:12.210 --> 00:36:12.990
Belongs on you.

00:36:15.100 --> 00:36:21.970
Makes me feel so like I was somebody.

00:36:30.510 --> 00:36:37.190
Where'd you get it? Where'd the money come from? Where'd you get it?

00:36:39.040 --> 00:36:41.890
I stole the money. I juggled the books and took $3,000.

00:36:43.200 --> 00:36:45.420
You? You stole?

00:36:47.900 --> 00:36:53.430
The way we were going, you wanting things, things you ought to have, and me strapped all the time.

00:36:53.610 --> 00:36:59.980
We were heading for a split up. See, I just had to.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:06.130
All my life, the one thing I really wanted was a fur coat.

00:37:09.680 --> 00:37:11.240
I can't give it up. I won't.

00:37:11.360 --> 00:37:11.920
No, darling.

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:14.900
What if something should happen?

00:37:15.060 --> 00:37:19.160
Nothing that happens could matter unless I lost you.

00:37:39.310 --> 00:37:46.760
evening tom oh captain sorry about that little incident this morning those things happen you

