We've been over that before, Captain.

00:38:04.080 --> 00:38:06.500
Before, you didn't need my help as much as you do now.

00:38:07.400 --> 00:38:09.340
I'm in a position to make things easier for you.

00:38:10.210 --> 00:38:11.190
Like you did for Wilson?

00:38:12.590 --> 00:38:15.820
Wilson was careless. Careless people have accidents.

00:38:24.870 --> 00:38:26.490
Quite a kick out of censoring the mail.

00:38:28.140 --> 00:38:29.960
All these letters you write home, for example...

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:33.710
