00:38:50.620 --> 00:38:52.060
I'm the one that decides that.

00:38:53.670 --> 00:38:57.140
I'm the only one who can help you, no one else.

00:39:00.030 --> 00:39:06.390
A cheap thief. I know I'm a failure, but I'm not an informer.

00:39:08.640 --> 00:39:12.560
That's what I like to see in a man. Stability. Fidelity.

00:39:14.830 --> 00:39:16.770
You're right, Lister. We're both wasting our time.

00:39:18.610 --> 00:39:22.190
Me by talking to you and you by writing to your wife.

00:39:23.800 --> 00:39:26.040
Captain, you've heard from her. By mail this morning.

00:39:27.090 --> 00:39:28.690
Please, please, Captain, tell me.

00:39:29.560 --> 00:39:29.980
In a way...

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:31.240
Tom, you're a free man.

00:39:32.050 --> 00:39:33.070
She's divorcing you.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:26.700
I'm going to try to talk some sense to you.

00:40:26.840 --> 00:40:27.940
I'm going to land right on the line.

00:40:29.580 --> 00:40:29.960
There has been...

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:34.590
recent weeks amounting unrest in this prison don't think for one minute that i don't know about it

00:40:35.280 --> 00:40:41.550
up to now you've enjoyed the regulation privileges however if you persist in fighting among yourselves

00:40:42.640 --> 00:40:46.480
antagonizing the guards and making way for accidents like the one that happened in the

00:40:46.480 --> 00:40:54.160
machine shop this morning then all your privileges will be revoked at once be careful

00:40:54.160 --> 00:40:59.550
of your associates always remember that one bad prisoner can spoil things for the rest of you

00:41:00.090 --> 00:41:01.010
So watch your step.

00:41:02.020 --> 00:41:06.470
It's up to you to protect your own interests, as I am compelled to protect mine.

00:41:07.260 --> 00:41:09.300
If there's one more infraction of the rules,

00:41:10.050 --> 00:41:12.550
if you cannot conduct yourselves without creating a disturbance,

00:41:13.160 --> 00:41:14.640
without further accidents,

00:41:15.440 --> 00:41:18.560
then I shall have to use every means to keep you under control.

00:41:19.650 --> 00:41:20.570
So that's it, men.

00:41:21.000 --> 00:41:25.700
Meet me halfway, and you can depend on me to see that every prisoner is treated fairly.

