You fought the warden, the guards, and me.

00:42:38.820 --> 00:42:40.260
You're not fit for civil life.

00:42:40.700 --> 00:42:41.980
And you won't accept prison life.

00:42:43.060 --> 00:42:44.580
So tomorrow you'll begin a new life.

00:42:45.580 --> 00:42:47.220
You'll all report for work in the drain pipe.

