We sent some men out in the boat.

00:44:09.700 --> 00:44:10.560
They landed up here.

00:44:11.500 --> 00:44:12.840
We covered them with a heavy bombardment.

00:44:13.700 --> 00:44:15.630
At HR, we attacked uphill.

00:44:18.180 --> 00:44:19.760
Crowds turned all their guns to stop us.

00:44:20.730 --> 00:44:22.790
That was exactly when the other gang attacked from behind.

00:44:23.320 --> 00:44:25.820
And it worked.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:32.790
That's true, all right. Most of us, anyway.

00:44:33.930 --> 00:44:34.810
Rest is still there.

00:44:51.170 --> 00:44:52.790
Couldn't cover both sides, huh?

00:44:54.730 --> 00:44:55.290
Thanks, soldier.

00:44:55.690 --> 00:44:58.660
How's that tie-in with us, Joe? What are you getting at?

00:44:59.050 --> 00:44:59.410
Tomorrow.

00:45:01.470 --> 00:45:02.530
We'll see tomorrow.

00:45:02.750 --> 00:45:08.470
I was just thinking.

00:45:09.400 --> 00:45:12.900
An insurance company could go flat broke in this prison.

00:45:13.020 --> 00:45:27.230
Good morning, Louis.

00:45:28.900 --> 00:45:29.260
Good morning.

00:45:43.790 --> 00:45:46.590
I know how you feel, Gallagher, and I'm sorry, but that's it.

00:45:46.750 --> 00:45:47.870
But it doesn't add up, warden.

00:45:48.240 --> 00:45:50.280
You're punishing all of us because Lister took his life.

00:45:50.460 --> 00:45:50.620
Why?

00:45:50.880 --> 00:45:52.020
Things are out of hand, that's why.

00:45:52.590 --> 00:45:53.630
It's the only decision we could make.

00:45:53.710 --> 00:45:54.550
Wait, you mean Muncie?

00:45:54.630 --> 00:45:56.080
No, I'm the warden here.

00:45:56.240 --> 00:45:56.880
This is my order.

00:45:56.960 --> 00:45:57.540
It's his work.

00:45:57.800 --> 00:45:59.980
I've heard complaints about Muncie for years, and I'm sick of him.

00:46:01.150 --> 00:46:02.670
Once he knows his job, and he does his job.

00:46:03.200 --> 00:46:05.640
Gallagher, I've tried my best to do the right thing by the men,

00:46:05.740 --> 00:46:06.720
but it's just no use.

00:46:06.980 --> 00:46:08.420
