00:47:57.230 --> 00:47:58.750
Message, Collins, train pipe.

00:47:58.950 --> 00:47:59.970
We're hot, gotta be done.

00:48:01.210 --> 00:48:13.960
uh smell that now you know what happened to rin tin tin western union who's on the gab about

00:48:14.460 --> 00:48:19.480
every day i have to take out of them guys down in a drain pipe i don't like the jobs

00:48:19.480 --> 00:48:26.050
the air down there is very unsanitary don't breathe in just breathe out

