01:28:39.400 --> 01:28:42.480
Joe, me. You?

01:28:43.310 --> 01:28:49.950
There'll be no discredit to you. You'll go away for a short while.

01:28:50.330 --> 01:28:52.490
When you get back, we'll try to fit you in someplace else.

01:28:53.890 --> 01:28:54.710
